{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんわ。\n皆さん今日も1日お疲れ様でした❤️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回のblogコメント沢山ありがとう。\nスカパーの事や,乃木團の事や,私の好きな所を沢山書いてくださり,本当に嬉しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも皆さんからの暖かいメッセージで元気をもらってます。 本当にありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"11th 「命は美しい」ジャケ写, off shot"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2015/03/02/9439965/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いい天気...気持ちよかったです．"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2015/03/02/9439965/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん,花粉は大丈夫ですか？\n私も花粉症持ちなので辛い気持ちはすごく分かります（ ｉ _ ｉ ）\nでも私は4月がピークなので今はまだ大丈夫です♩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまいから\nお揃いのギター型イヤホン収納をもらったよ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2015/03/02/9439965/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛い～。\n貰ってから早速使ってるよん❤️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これは のぎ天の私服で撮影した時のです.＊"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2015/03/02/9439965/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか本当むっちゃ寒かったぁぁ（ ｉ _ ｉ ）\n上半身完全防備。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2015/03/02/9439965/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これはUTB＋の off shot♩\n撮影は12月でした。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2015/03/02/9439965/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山ジャンプしたよん。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2015/03/02/9439965/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごい寒かったけど、楽しかったあ❤️"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2015/03/02/9439965/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モバメや755にも書いたんだけど、\n2月から高校の友達が上京してきたの！\n土曜にやっと会えたんだあ（＾ω＾）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからは大阪に行かなくても、東京ですぐに友達と会えると思うと すっごく嬉しい♩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それとそれと！！\nこないだ まあやが広島に居る家族とTV電話してたの(*^_^*)\nだから私も一緒に2時間位TV電話しました♩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやのお母ちゃん,お父ちゃん,お兄ちゃん本当に大好き！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またblog更新するね。\nおやすみなさい❤️"}],"source":"archive"}